        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="base-context" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:19px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:10px;&quot;&gt;A. CONTEXT ĐẦU VÀO&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.38;&quot;&gt;Schema của &lt;b&gt;đúng một bảng&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Tên bảng / cột • Kiểu dữ liệu • Constraints&lt;br/&gt;Metadata mô tả nguồn nếu có&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F1F5F9;strokeColor=#94A3B8;fontColor=#0F172A;strokeWidth=1.5;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=17;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=18;spacingRight=16;spacingTop=12;spacingBottom=12;" vertex="1" parent="base-prompt">
          <mxGeometry x="20" y="60" width="550" height="140" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="base-rules" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:10px;&quot;&gt;B. CHỈ DẪN CHO LLM&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.38;&quot;&gt;• Đặt tên / mô tả Class và từng Property.&lt;br/&gt;• Mỗi cột tương ứng đúng một Property.&lt;br/&gt;• Methods: &lt;b&gt;list • lookup • count • aggregate&lt;/b&gt;.&lt;br/&gt;• Chỉ đọc bảng hiện tại; không JOIN / tạo cột mới.&lt;br/&gt;• Không khẳng định business rules thiếu bằng chứng.&lt;br/&gt;• Class: PascalCase; Property / Method: lowerCamelCase.&lt;br/&gt;• Tên tiếng Anh; mô tả tiếng Việt.&lt;br/&gt;• Feedback review đã đối chiếu nguồn, nếu có.&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#EFF6FF;strokeColor=#60A5FA;fontColor=#1E3A8A;strokeWidth=1.5;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=16;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=18;spacingRight=16;spacingTop=12;spacingBottom=12;" vertex="1" parent="base-prompt">
          <mxGeometry x="20" y="230" width="550" height="270" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="base-contract" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:10px;&quot;&gt;C. LLM RESPONSE CONTRACT&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.38;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;JSON bắt buộc:&lt;/b&gt; Class • Properties • Methods&lt;br/&gt;assumptions • confidence&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Method:&lt;/b&gt; operation • input • output • cột sử dụng&lt;br/&gt;filter / operator • group_by • aggregation khi có&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#EFF6FF;strokeColor=#60A5FA;fontColor=#1E3A8A;strokeWidth=1.5;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=16;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=18;spacingRight=16;spacingTop=12;spacingBottom=12;" vertex="1" parent="base-prompt">
          <mxGeometry x="20" y="530" width="550" height="160" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="base-message-note" value="Chỉ dẫn → system prompt     |     Context + contract → user prompt" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=14;fontColor=#64748B;fontStyle=0;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="stage2">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="820" width="570" height="23" as="geometry" />
